* ADG5248F 8:1 analog multiplexer, channel S1 selected
.include ADG5248F.cir

VDD VDD 0 15
VSS VSS 0 -15

VIN IN 0 SINE(0 0.5 1k)

VA0 A0 0 0
VA1 A1 0 0
VA2 A2 0 0
VEN EN 0 5

RIN1 IN S1 1m
VS2 S2 0 0
VS3 S3 0 0
VS4 S4 0 0
VS5 S5 0 0
VS6 S6 0 0
VS7 S7 0 0
VS8 S8 0 0

* Vendor-model pin order follows the physical 16-pin package:
* A0 EN VSS S1 S2 S3 S4 D S8 S7 S6 S5 VDD GND A2 A1
XMUX A0 EN VSS S1 S2 S3 S4 OUT S8 S7 S6 S5 VDD 0 A2 A1 ADG5248F

RLOAD OUT 0 100k

.tran 0 10m 5m 2u
.meas tran VIN_PP PP V(IN) FROM 5m TO 10m
.meas tran VOUT_PP PP V(OUT) FROM 5m TO 10m
.meas tran gain_db PARAM 20*log10(VOUT_PP/VIN_PP)

.end
